  <section class="section" style="margin-bottom: 100px;">
    <div class="container legal-content reveal">
      <p>polarfincorp.com (“we”, “us”) respects your privacy. This policy explains what data we collect, how we use it, and your rights.</p>
      <h2>1. Data we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Identity data:</strong> name, date of birth, government ID for KYC.</li>
        <li><strong>Contact data:</strong> email, phone number, postal address.</li>
        <li><strong>Financial data:</strong> bank account, transactions, holdings.</li>
        <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> IP address, device, browser, usage analytics.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>2. How we use your data</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To provide and operate the Services</li>
        <li>To comply with legal and regulatory obligations (AML, KYC, tax)</li>
        <li>To improve product features and prevent fraud</li>
        <li>To send service-related and (with consent) marketing communications</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>3. Sharing your data</h2>
      <p>We share data with regulated service providers (custodians, KYC/AML vendors, payment processors), regulators when legally required, and successors in the event of a merger or acquisition. We never sell personal data.</p>
      <h2>4. International transfers</h2>
      <p>Data may be processed in countries outside your home jurisdiction. We use standard contractual clauses and equivalent safeguards.</p>
      <h2>5. Retention</h2>
      <p>We retain personal data for as long as your account is active and as required by law (typically 5–7 years after account closure for financial records).</p>
      <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
      <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have rights to access, correct, delete, restrict, or port your data. Email <a href="mailto:support@polarfincorp.com">support@polarfincorp.com</a> to exercise these rights.</p>
      <h2>7. Security</h2>
      <p>We use encryption in transit and at rest, multi-factor authentication, and continuous monitoring. No system is 100% secure, but we work hard to keep yours protected.</p>
      <h2>8. Contact</h2>
      <p>Data Protection Officer — <a href="mailto:support@polarfincorp.com">support@polarfincorp.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

